  <h2>Information on this website</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep information on this site accurate, but it is provided for general guidance. Photographs show
    representative designs and finishes; actual materials, colours and dimensions are confirmed in your project drawings
    and quotation.
  </p>

  <h2>Packages and pricing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Package prices are in Indian Rupees and cover the items listed for each package.</li>
    <li>Work outside the listed items, changes in size or specification, and site conditions may change the final price.</li>
    <li>The final scope, price, payment schedule and timeline are set out in your written quotation.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>
    Sending an enquiry does not create a contract or obligation for either side. We’ll use your details as described in our
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
